  "notable_quotes": [
    "For MFI/ZSM-5, the straight channel remains the preferred diffusion pathway regardless of loading or temperature, so loading cannot switch pathways.",
    "As loading increases, adsorbates preferentially move through larger channels because continuum intersection channels present a lower diffusion barrier.",
    "At low loading, strong adsorption sites plus molecular reorientation at intersections drive almost exclusive diffusion through the smaller channels."
